# Build context for `deploy/services/Dockerfile`, whose context is the repo root.
#
# BuildKit reads `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` in preference to the context root's `.dockerignore`, so
# this file trims **only** this build. That matters: a root `.dockerignore` would be picked up by
# `git archive` into the room image's staged context (`room/image/build.sh`) and change what the
# **measured** image sees, which is the one thing in this repo that must not move by accident.
#
# Without this, the context was 20.6 GB and took nearly three minutes to transfer, because `target/`
# alone is multi-gigabyte. The build runs `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` itself, so none of the
# installed or compiled output needs to be sent.
.git
node_modules
**/node_modules
target
**/dist
**/.next
**/*.profraw
# Keys, manifests and env files must never reach an image layer.
deploy/.keys
deploy/manifest.*.json
**/.env
**/.env.*
# The embedder's weights are ~90 MB and belong to the room's own image, not to the host services.
room/models
# Circuit artefacts and the proving key are not used by these three services.
circuits
